    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## V3 File Upload v2.2\n\nFixes the n8n Code node error:\n`A 'json' property isn't an object [item 0]`\n\nCause:\n`Find New File` was configured as `Run Once for Each Item`\nbut returned an array of n8n items.\n\nFix:\n`Find New File` now runs as `Run Once for All Items`.\n\nIt can safely return:\n- 0 items;\n- 1 new file;\n- several new files.\n\nThe rest of the v2.1 logic is unchanged:\nrecord_id → file_urls → PostgreSQL token → BYTEA → Airtable direct upload.",
        "height": 360
      },
